{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17629","headline":"州民自言巴土冬湿且多阴晦今兹晴朗苦寒霜颇甚故老或异之因示寮吏 · 羊士谔","name":"州民自言巴土冬湿且多阴晦今兹晴朗苦寒霜颇甚故老或异之因示寮吏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨霜以成岁，看旧感前闻。\n爱景随朝日，凝阴积暮云。\n囗囗囗囗囗，忘言酒暂醺。\n囗囗囗囗囗，囗囗囗囗囗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}